sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Frontend Dashboard
    participant API as Java API Layer
    participant Cache as Caffeine Cache (TTL 15s)
    participant Rule as Rule Engine
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/dashboard/revenue
    API->>Rule: Extract Rule for 'revenue'
    Rule->>Cache: Check Cached Result
    
    alt Cache Miss
        Cache->>DB: Execute Query (Covering Index)
        DB-->>Cache: Result Data
    end
    
    Cache-->>API: Return Result
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (Chart Data)\n